  platysma: ['muscle', 'Platysma', 'thin front-of-neck muscle', 'Very thin sheet of muscle under the skin of the front of the neck.', 'Tenses the neck skin and pulls the mouth corners down.', 'Rarely a pain source; front-neck pain needs checking for throat, thyroid or vascular causes.'],
