  scalenes: ['muscle', 'Scalenes', 'side-of-neck muscles', 'Three muscles from the neck vertebrae to the first two ribs; the brachial plexus (arm nerve bundle) passes between them.', 'Side-bend the neck and lift the upper ribs when breathing.', 'Tight scalenes refer pain to the chest, shoulder blade and arm and can squeeze the arm nerves (thoracic outlet syndrome).'],
