  upper_trap: ['muscle', 'Upper trapezius', 'neck-to-shoulder muscle', 'Upper fibres of the large diamond-shaped trapezius, from the skull base and neck to the collarbone and acromion.', 'Shrugs and rotates the shoulder blade upward; tilts the neck.', 'The most common neck/shoulder trigger point; refers pain up the side of the neck to the temple and behind the ear.'],
