  thor_erector: ['muscle', 'Thoracic erector spinae', 'mid-back spine muscles', 'Long muscle columns (iliocostalis, longissimus, spinalis) beside the mid-back spine.', 'Straighten and side-bend the trunk, keep posture upright.', 'Postural ache and spasm in the mid-back; overlie the facet and rib joints.'],
  lumb_erector: ['muscle', 'Lumbar erector spinae', 'low-back spine muscles', 'Thick muscle columns either side of the low-back spine.', 'Straighten the spine and control bending and lifting.', 'The commonest source of acute muscular low back pain and protective spasm.'],
