  lats: ['muscle', 'Latissimus dorsi', 'broad back muscle', 'Broad back muscle from the lower spine, pelvis and lower ribs to the front of the upper arm bone.', 'Pulls the arm down and back (climbing, rowing).', 'Mid-back or armpit pain with overhead reaching; refers to the lower tip of the shoulder blade.'],
  serratus_ant: ['muscle', 'Serratus anterior', 'side-of-ribs muscle', 'Finger-like slips on the side of the rib cage attaching to the inner border of the shoulder blade.', 'Holds the shoulder blade on the ribs and rotates it for overhead reach.', 'Side-of-chest pain worse with deep breaths; nerve weakness causes a "winged" shoulder blade.'],
