  tib_post: ['muscle', 'Tibialis posterior', 'deep arch-support muscle', 'Deep calf muscle whose tendon passes behind the inner ankle bone to the arch.', 'Supports the arch and turns the sole inward.', 'Inner shin/ankle pain; failure leads to a collapsing arch. Involved in medial shin splints.'],
