  thumb_abd: ['muscle', 'Thumb muscles of the forearm (APL, EPB, EPL)', 'thumb-moving forearm muscles', 'Forearm muscles whose tendons run along the thumb side of the wrist.', 'Move and straighten the thumb.', 'De Quervain\'s tenosynovitis: pain at the thumb side of the wrist with gripping.'],
