  hand_intrinsics: ['muscle', 'Interossei & lumbricals', 'small hand muscles', 'Small muscles between and around the hand bones.', 'Spread, close and fine-tune the fingers.', 'Cramp with repetitive fine work; wasting suggests ulnar nerve or C8–T1 problems.'],
  // ---------- bones
