  facial_bones: ['bone', 'Facial bones (maxilla, zygoma, nasal)', 'cheek, upper-jaw and nose bones', 'Bones forming the cheeks, upper jaw, nose and eye sockets; contain the sinuses.', 'Support the face, teeth and sinuses.', 'Cheek/forehead pressure is often sinus-related; dental problems refer here.'],
